{"id":46,"source":"api.quran.com/v4/quran/verses/uthmani_tajweed","updated":"2026-08-23","verses":[{"id":1,"tajweed":"ح<span class=\"tj tj-madda_necessary\">مٓ</span> <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>١</span>"},{"id":2,"tajweed":"تَ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نز</span>ِيلُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْكِتَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>بِ مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْعَزِيزِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَك<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مِ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٢</span>"},{"id":3,"tajweed":"مَا خَلَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">قْ</span>نَا <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>و<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">َٰ</span>تِ وَ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضَ وَمَا بَيْنَهُم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> إِلَّا بِ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَقِّ وَأَجَ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">لٍ م</span>ُّسَم<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">ًّى‌ۚ و</span>َ<span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> عَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span><span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نذ</span>ِرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مُعْرِض<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ُو</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٣</span>"},{"id":4,"tajweed":"قُلْ أَرَءَيْت<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_shafawi\">ُم م</span>َّا تَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>عُونَ مِ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">ن د</span>ُونِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ أَرُونِى مَاذَا خَلَقُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْأَرْضِ أَمْ لَهُمْ شِرْ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">كٌ ف</span>ِى <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>سَّمَ<s