ible\">ِي</span>نَ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٦</span>"},{"id":7,"tajweed":"وَإِذَا تُتْلَىٰ عَلَيْهِمْ ءَايَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>تُنَا بَيِّنَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span><span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">تٍ ق</span>َالَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لَّذِينَ كَفَرُو<span class=\"tj tj-silent\">اْ</span> لِلْحَقِّ لَ<span class=\"tj tj-ghunnah\">مّ</span>َا ج<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َا</span>ٓءَهُمْ هَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ـٰ</span>ذَا سِحْ<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رٌ م</span>ُّب<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>نٌ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٧</span>"},{"id":8,"tajweed":"أَمْ يَقُولُونَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>فْتَرَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ىٰ</span>هُ‌ۖ قُلْ إِنِ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>فْتَرَيْتُهُ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> فَلَا تَمْلِكُونَ لِى مِنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>للَّهِ شَيْــًٔا‌ۖ هُوَ أَعْلَمُ بِمَا تُفِيضُونَ فِيهِ‌ۖ كَفَىٰ بِه<span class=\"tj tj-madda_normal\">ِۦ</span> شَهِيد<span class=\"tj tj-iqlab\">َۢا ب</span>َيْنِى وَبَيْنَكُمْ‌ۖ وَهُوَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْغَفُورُ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رَّح<span class=\"tj tj-madda_permissible\">ِي</span>مُ <span class=\"tj tj-end\" hidden>٨</span>"},{"id":9,"tajweed":"قُلْ مَا كُ<span class=\"tj tj-ikhafa\">نت</span>ُ بِ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span><span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">عًا م</span>ِّنَ <span class=\"tj tj-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span><span class=\"tj tj-laam_shamsiyah\">ل</span>رُّسُلِ وَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَ<span class=\"tj tj-qlqalah\">دْ</span>رِى مَا يُفْعَلُ بِى وَلَا بِكُمْ‌ۖ إِنْ أَتَّبِعُ إِلَّا مَا يُوحَ<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">ىٰٓ</span> إِلَىَّ وَم<span class=\"tj tj-madda_obligatory\">َآ</span> أَنَا۟ إِلَّا نَذِي<span class=\"tj tj-idgham_ghunnah\">رٌ م</span>ُّب<span class=\